## MKFF's own audio codecs

`mkff-audio-core`, `mkff-mp3`, `mkff-aac`, `mkff-flac`, `mkff-alac`, `mkff-ac3`,
`mkff-vorbis`, `mkff-audio-format`, `mkff-audio` and `mkff-mediakit` are written
for MKFF from the public specifications (ISO/IEC 11172-3, 13818-3, 13818-7,
14496-3, 14496-12/14; ETSI TS 102 366; RFC 9639; the Vorbis I and Ogg
specifications; the ALAC format description; EBU Tech 3306) under the MIT
License. They contain no third-party code.
